          "feedback": "Use 'qui est-ce QUI' for who DOES something (subject). Same rule as qu'est-ce qui/que!"
        },
        {
          "answer": "qui est-ce que parle",
          "feedback": "Use 'qui est-ce QUI' when the person is doing the action. QUI = subject!"
        }
      ]
    },
